المبرد والوقود، بينما يتكيف كل من التشغيل متعدد الوحدات، والأجهزة والتحكم الرقمية. افتراض تخطيطي، ولا يعني ذلك أي قرار بالنشر.', 'Hazard identification, permits, drills and the emergency organisation''s roles stay the same.', 'يبقى تحديد المخاطر والتصاريح والتمارين وأدوار منظمة الطوارئ كما هي.', '[{"skill_id":"sk-fs-adv-smr","level":1},{"skill_id":"sk-fs-adv-multimodule","level":1},{"skill_id":"sk-fs-adv-passive","level":1},{"skill_id":"sk-fs-dp-dic","level":1}]'::jsonb, '[{"kind":"microcred","ref":"MC-SMR-FOUND"},{"kind":"course","ref":"c-fs-smr"},{"kind":"pathway","ref":"pw-adv-smr-l1"},{"kind":"course","ref":"c-fs-passive"},{"kind":"pathway","ref":"pw-adv-passive-l1"},{"kind":"pathway","ref":"pw-dp-dic-l1"},{"kind":"pathway","ref":"pw-adv-multimodule-l1"},{"kind":"lane","ref":"lane-advanced"}]'::jsonb, '{}'::text[], '[{"id":"ans-smr-wf-2025","label":"ANS Nuclear Newswire · Education and training to support Canadian nuclear workforce development (26 Nov 2025)","url":"https://www.ans.org/news/2025-11-26/article-7471/education-and-training-to-support-canadian-nuclear-workforce-development/","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"iaea-ng-t-3-10","label":"IAEA NG-T-3.10 · Workforce Planning for New Nuclear Power Programmes (2011)","url":"https://www-pub.iaea.org/MTCD/Publications/PDF/Pub1477_web.pdf","as_of":"2026-10-10"},{"id":"gevh-smr-centre-2025","label":"GE Vernova · GE Vernova Hitachi SMR engineering and service centre, Ontario (June 2025)","url":"https://www.gevernova.com/news/press-releases/ge-vernova-hitachi-nuclear-energy-canada-small-modular-reactor-engineering-service-centre-ontario","as_of":"2026-10-10"}]'::jsonb, array['SMR-WF','IAEA-WFP']::text[], 'published', true, 1, '2026-10-11', 69, 'p-training-mgr', '2026-10-11T08:00:00Z'),
